 what you shall see, Kyyaz."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b002:l026","ordinal":309991,"en":"At a woman’s word, into your sheath"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b002:l027","ordinal":309992,"en":"You are one who shrinks, Kyyaz;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b002:l028","ordinal":309993,"en":"From the crown of your head, the one God"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b002:l029","ordinal":309994,"en":"Is sure to strike you, Kyyaz!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b002:l030","ordinal":309995,"en":"Letting a woman take your horse"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b002:l031","ordinal":309996,"en":"Is how you live, Kyyaz;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b002:l032","ordinal":309997,"en":"Headfirst into the earth"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b002:l033","ordinal":309998,"en":"You are sure to go, Kyyaz;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b002:l034","ordinal":309999,"en":"Chasing after women, great affliction"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b002:l035","ordinal":310000,"en":"Is what you shall meet, Kyyaz."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b002:l036","ordinal":310001,"en":"You ranged among nations and ruled the people,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b002:l037","ordinal":310002,"en":"You were mighty Kyyaz,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b002:l038","ordinal":310003,"en":"But enslaved to a single woman"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b002:l039","ordinal":310004,"en":"Is what you have become, Kyyaz!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b002:l040","ordinal":310005,"en":"You have courage but no sense;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b003:l001","ordinal":310006,"en":"He fitted an arrow to the bow."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b003:l002","ordinal":310007,"en":"He seized the specially fashioned whip"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b003:l003","ordinal":310008,"en":"And swung it round,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b003:l004","ordinal":310009,"en":"Making the poor beast cry out"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b003:l005","ordinal":310010,"en":"As he lashed it on the rump,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b003:l006","ordinal":310011,"en":"Driving it at a rolling gallop,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b003:l007","ordinal":310012,"en":"Making it stride like a maral,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b003:l008","ordinal":310013,"en":"Its eyes reddening like a wild ram’s."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b003:l009","ordinal":310014,"en":"From before brave Kyyaz"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b003:l010","ordinal":310015,"en":"She led it away with skill,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0193:b003:l011","ordinal":310016,"en":"And when she wheeled it aside,"}]
